    "text": "THE allotments specified in the Order No. 72 of 2019 made under the Proviso (a) to Section 38 of the Land Acquisition Act, (Chapter 460) and published in the Gazette Extraordinary No. 2117/58 dated 05 th April, 2019 are vested absolutely in the State and the possession of which has been taken for or on behalf of the State under Paragraph (a) of Section 40 of the aforesaid Act. But by the virtue of powers vested in me by Sub - section (1) of Section 39(a) (inserted by Act, No. 8 of 1979) of the Land Acquisition Act, I, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation, do hereby divest only the allotments specified in the Schedule below:",
